WEBVTT

00:07:58.516 --> 00:08:01.393
You take what works, discard what doesn't,

00:08:01.435 --> 00:08:03.103
and apply it to modern designs.

00:08:03.562 --> 00:08:04.855
In one instance,

00:08:04.897 --> 00:08:08.150
the wind-dispersing capabilities
of those traditional louvers

00:08:08.192 --> 00:08:09.985
became a modern interpretation.

00:08:10.361 --> 00:08:14.281
So my team and I at the time
designed a timber fin facade

00:08:14.281 --> 00:08:15.699
that would do the same thing:

00:08:15.699 --> 00:08:18.953
break up the wind
against the building's exterior

00:08:18.953 --> 00:08:22.498
while still allowing light to penetrate
to the building's interior,

00:08:22.498 --> 00:08:25.042
all while protecting the exposed
glass from wind

00:08:25.042 --> 00:08:26.835
and wind driven missiles.

00:08:26.877 --> 00:08:28.546
So no more duct tape.

00:08:29.213 --> 00:08:30.422
In another instance,